        {
          "text": "Ngalokho isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Bheka, ngiyakunikela izwe laseGibithe kuNebukadinesari, inkosi yaseBabele; iyakuthatha isixuku salo, aphange impango yalo, aphange impango yalo; futhi lokhu kuyoba umvuzo webutho lakhe.",
